#: src/modules/alsa/alsa-util.c:1296
#, c-format
msgid ""
"snd_pcm_avail_delay() returned strange values: delay %lu is less than avail "
"%lu.\n"
"Most likely this is a bug in the ALSA driver '%s'. Please report this issue "
"to the ALSA developers."
